================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY DATASET LICENSING DISCLOSURE
================================================================================

The PreVisS-Net software code is licensed under the MIT License above. The benchmark
datasets utilized for training and evaluation remain under their respective original
licenses and terms of use:

1. Dataset D1 (Potato Crop Stress - INIA Carillanca, Chile):
   - Modality: Multispectral (Green, Red, RedEdge, NIR) + RGB
   - Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0)
   - DOI / Reference: 10.5281/zenodo.4705128

2. Dataset D2 (Slovenian UAV Agriculture - Vipava Valley, Slovenia):
   - Modality: UAV Multispectral GeoTIFF Orthomosaics
   - Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC-BY-NC 4.0)
   - DOI / Reference: 10.5281/zenodo.5512940

3. Dataset D3 (Controlled Hyperspectral Drought Stress - ETH Zurich, Switzerland):
   - Modality: 204-band VNIR/SWIR Hyperspectral Reflectance Signatures
   - Licence: Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication
   - DOI / Reference: 10.3929/ethz-b-000412850

4. Dataset D4 (Global Nitrogen Deficiency Multi-Crop Benchmark - INRAE / Cirad):
   - Modality: Agronomic Nitrogen Nutrition Index (NNI) + Spectral Indices
   - Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0)
   - DOI / Reference: 10.5281/zenodo.6821945

5. Dataset D5 (Global Environmental Stress Multi-Sensor Repository - Kaggle / OpenData):
   - Modality: Environmental & Multi-Band Meteorological / Reflectance Records
   - Licence: Open Data Commons Attribution License (ODC-By v1.0)
   - Reference: Kaggle Open Datasets Repository

6. Dataset D6 (Indian UAV Paddy Rice Field Survey - Tamil Nadu Agricultural University):
   - Modality: UAV Micro-Spatial RGB Aerial Survey
   - Licence: Academic Non-Commercial Research License
   - Reference: TNAU Precision Agriculture Field Repository
